      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَضحّى</span></b> : see 1, latter half. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And see 2,
in two places. It [generally] means <i>He ate in
the time of morning called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الضُّحَى</span>: (K:) or <i>he
ate the</i> [<i>morning-meal called</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَدَآء</span>; syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَغَدَّى</span>:
(S, TA:) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضحّى</span></b>  also has the former [or
the latter] meaning. (ISd, TA.)

